<title>USA: Focus Enhancements names officer.</title>
<headline>Focus Enhancements names officer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Focus Enhancements Inc said it named Harry Mitchel chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company did not say who he replaced and when the position was effective. Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
</text>
